{"id":"repentinamente","lemma":"repentinamente","pos":"adv","rank":4583,"glosses":["suddenly; unexpectedly; out of nowhere; out of the blue"],"ipa":"/repenˌtinaˈmente/","examples":[{"text":"Repentinamente empecé a ganar peso.","en":"I've suddenly started to gain weight.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/531732","words":[null,{"g":"to start","l":"empezar"},{"g":"to"},null,null],"phrases":[[3,5,"to put on weight"]]},{"text":"Él falleció repentinamente.","en":"He passed away quite suddenly.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/526994","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"to pass away, die","l":"fallecer"},null]},{"text":"El clima cambió repentinamente.","en":"The weather changed suddenly.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/735683","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"climate, weather"},{"g":"to change","l":"cambiar"},null]},{"text":"Todo terminó tan repentinamente como comenzó.","en":"It all ended as suddenly as it started.","words":[{"g":"all"},{"g":"to finish","l":"terminar"},{"g":"so, as"},null,{"g":"as"},{"g":"to begin, to commence","l":"comenzar"}]},{"text":"La tragedia sucedió repentinamente.","en":"The tragedy happened suddenly.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"tragedy, catastrophe"},{"g":"to happen","l":"suceder"},null]}]}